&lt;b&gt;VD&lt;/b&gt; 6 m (4 &lt;abbr title=&quot;cases&quot;&gt;c&lt;/abbr&gt;)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Corps &#224; corps&lt;/b&gt; &#233;pieu, +1 (1d6+1)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;A distance&lt;/b&gt; &#233;pieu, +0 (1d6+1)
&lt;/div&gt;
